      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: As far as I know it's been around since soft-launch but it's probably too early to tell if it's caused many issues. My main problem with bluesky's version of it is that the lists can only be edited by a single person rather than a group of people which is why I proposed integrating it into group moderation.\n\nI definitely agree that it's risky and I'm mostly just proposing it to get more perspectives for that reason. It's not something I expect to be added without a lot of thought behind it.",
