      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The more I've thought about it the more I've come to realize that the way moderation is handled through Groups Public instances is pretty elegant already and I think expanding upon that is probably smarter than implementing a completely different (and iffy) system.\n\nI'll leave this post up for others to vote on and discuss further and whatnot but I personally no longer think it's a super necessary thing to explore :]",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
